{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rqd4vmtw","slide":3,"text":"BikeMate responds to a practical gap in motorcycle repair access.","textPreview":"BikeMate responds to a practical gap in motorcycle repair access.","textChars":65,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,82,900,92]}
